  "dateReleased": "2026-11-04",
  "releaseNotes": "Prepares for the lower API rate limits Netatmo plans from March 1, 2027. Reaching Netatmo's limit used to be treated as a bad token, which renewed it and retried; it now backs off and resumes by itself, and you stay authorized. A rule refreshing several devices together now makes one Netatmo request. New, off by default: webhooks (beta). Netatmo tells the hub when there is something new, and scheduled polls stand down while webhooks are arriving and resume by themselves if they stop. Webhooks have not yet been run against Netatmo's live service, so treat them as a trial; polling carries on if they don't work.",
